@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Exact per-function analysis cache — rebuild, compare, replay, and bound

actor "caller\nowns lifetime + limits" as CALLER #FFE8CC
file "source revision\n+ language/options" as SOURCE #DBE4FF
rectangle "tree-sitter + explicit\nAST construction worklist" as AST #DBE4FF
collections "stable function contexts\nlocal nodes + dependency boundary" as CONTEXT #C3FAE8
rectangle "canonical encoder\nschema + exact bytes + dimensions" as KEY #FFF3BF
database "digest index\nfull keys + local plans\nbounded LRU" as CACHE #E5DBFF
rectangle "full key equal\nand local plan valid?" as HIT #FFD8A8
rectangle "ordinary CFG/DFG/PDG\nheap-owned planner" as PLAN #FFE3E3
rectangle "expand local ordinals\nor localize fresh endpoints" as LOCAL #D3F9D8
rectangle "ordered graph emitter\nfresh NodeId domain" as EMIT #C3FAE8
database "new exact CPG" as CPG #B2F2BB
rectangle "deterministic LRU eviction\nuntil entry and byte bounds hold" as EVICT #F1F3F5

CALLER --> SOURCE : pass cache by mutable reference
SOURCE --> AST : always rebuild
AST --> CONTEXT : one-pass ownership scan\nor explicit Mode-B traversal
CONTEXT --> KEY : represented dependencies
KEY --> CACHE : digest selects bucket\nbytes decide equality
CACHE --> HIT : candidate or miss
HIT --> LOCAL : yes — retained local plan
HIT --> PLAN : no / bypass
PLAN --> LOCAL : prevalidate locality\nthen emit + translate
LOCAL --> EMIT : validated endpoints
EMIT --> CPG : stable ordered mutation
LOCAL --> CACHE : insert eligible miss
CACHE --> EVICT : capacity exceeded
EVICT --> CACHE : remove oldest exact entry
CPG --> CALLER : result + observable statistics

note right of HIT
  A digest collision cannot create a hit.
  Every retained canonical byte is compared.
end note

note bottom of AST
  Source/tree depth is heap state,
  never input-shaped native recursion.
end note

note bottom of CACHE
  Zero capacity selects the ordinary path.
  No global, thread-local, or persistent state.
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#FFE8CC>| caller ownership / ordinary planner |
  |<#DBE4FF>| authoritative source and AST |
  |<#C3FAE8>| canonical context / ordered emission |
  |<#FFF3BF>| exact key material |
  |<#E5DBFF>| bounded retained state |
  |<#FFD8A8>| exact admission decision |
  |<#D3F9D8>| coordinate transport |
  |<#FFE3E3>| fresh recomputation |
  |<#F1F3F5>| resource enforcement |
  |<#B2F2BB>| exact public result |
endlegend
@enduml
